---
description: Padrão de qualidade criativa do projeto (Creative OS)
alwaysApply: true
---

Always follow the standards defined in CLAUDE.md and CREATIVE-OS.md.

Never generate generic SaaS designs.

Always perform self-critique (Awwwards Judge, score 1–10, refactor anything below 9) before finalizing.

Always prioritize originality, storytelling, motion design and premium art direction.

The bar is $1M digital experiences (igloo.inc, activetheory.net, lusion.co, obys.agency tier). If it could be confused with a template or AI-generated layout, refactor.
